            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/0629697c2443e82195b61b1c97f64165.poster.avif?t=1791501193\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/0629697c2443e82195b61b1c97f64165.webm?t=1791501193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/0629697c2443e82195b61b1c97f64165.mp4?t=1791501193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Machinarium</i> is the award-winning adventure game from the makers of <i>Phonopolis</i>, <i>CHUCHEL</i> and <i>Samorost</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A little robot named Josef is thrown out into the scrapyard behind the city.<br>Help him find his way back, deal with the Black Cap Brotherhood and save his girlfriend Berta!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World:</strong> The world of <i>Machinarium</i> is populated only by robots of various shapes and functions. One of the most remarkable places is the old, rusty and legendary city of Machinarium, where the game takes place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> Get rid of the wicked robots from the Black Cap Brotherhood and save the mayor and your robot-girl friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Solve logic puzzles, adventure quests, brain teasers and mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics:</strong> Hand-drawn 2D backgrounds and characters, with more than an hour of carefully crafted animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> A beautiful original soundtrack composed and recorded by Tomáš Dvořák aka Floex.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication:</strong> No lengthy dialogue! Characters talk through comic bubbles with simple animations and symbols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/053861cf81f517df64dd25e474c97fe6.poster.avif?t=1791501193\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/053861cf81f517df64dd25e474c97fe6.webm?t=1791501193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/053861cf81f517df64dd25e474c97fe6.mp4?t=1791501193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/0629697c2443e82195b61b1c97f64165.poster.avif?t=1791501193\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/0629697c2443e82195b61b1c97f64165.webm?t=1791501193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/0629697c2443e82195b61b1c97f64165.mp4?t=1791501193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Machinarium</i> is the award-winning adventure game from the makers of <i>Phonopolis</i>, <i>CHUCHEL</i> and <i>Samorost</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A little robot named Josef is thrown out into the scrapyard behind the city.<br>Help him find his way back, deal with the Black Cap Brotherhood and save his girlfriend Berta!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World:</strong> The world of <i>Machinarium</i> is populated only by robots of various shapes and functions. One of the most remarkable places is the old, rusty and legendary city of Machinarium, where the game takes place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> Get rid of the wicked robots from the Black Cap Brotherhood and save the mayor and your robot-girl friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Solve logic puzzles, adventure quests, brain teasers and mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics:</strong> Hand-drawn 2D backgrounds and characters, with more than an hour of carefully crafted animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> A beautiful original soundtrack composed and recorded by Tomáš Dvořák aka Floex.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication:</strong> No lengthy dialogue! Characters talk through comic bubbles with simple animations and symbols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/053861cf81f517df64dd25e474c97fe6.poster.avif?t=1791501193\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/053861cf81f517df64dd25e474c97fe6.webm?t=1791501193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40700/extras/053861cf81f517df64dd25e474c97fe6.mp4?t=1791501193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
